  "question": {
    "text": "Let a function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi></math>&nbsp;be defined by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is",
    "image": null
  },
